td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"tracing.html\">Trace events</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_1\">(1) Experimental</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"tty.html\">TTY</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"dgram.html\">UDP/datagram sockets</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"url.html\">URL</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"util.html\">Util</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"vm.html\">VM (执行 JavaScript)</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"webcrypto.html\">Web Crypto API</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"webstreams.html\">Web Streams API</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"wasi.html\">WebAssembly System Interface (WASI)</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_1\">(1) Experimental</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"worker_threads.html\">Worker threads</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"zlib.html\">Zlib</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"single-executable-applications.html\">单可执行应用</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_1\">(1) .1 - Active development</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"dns.html\">域名系统 DNS</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"child_process.html\">子进程</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"async_context.html\">异步上下文追踪</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"async_hooks.html\">异步钩子</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_1\">(1) 实验性。如果可能，请迁移远离此 API。 我们不建议使用 [<code>createHook</code>][]、[<code>AsyncHook</code>][] 和 [<code>executionAsyncResource</code>][] API，因为它们存在可用性问题、安全风险 和性能影响。异步上下文跟踪用例更适合使用 稳定的 [<code>AsyncLocalStorage</code>][] API。如果你有超出 [<code>AsyncLocalStorage</code>][] 解决的上下文跟踪需求或 [Diagnostics Channel][] 当前提供的诊断数据 之外的 <code>createHook</code>、<code>AsyncHook</code> 或 <code>executionAsyncResource</code> 用例， 请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues\">https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues</a> 描述你的用例， 以便我们可以创建更专注的 API。</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"console.html\">控制台</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"fs.html\">文件系统</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr><tr><td class=\"module_stability\"><a href=\"test.html\">测试运行器</a></td><td class=\"api_stability api_stability_2\">(2) Stable</td></tr></tbody></table><!-- STABILITY_OVERVIEW_SLOT_END -->",
